  "description": "ONE RR FULL CARBON INTEGRATED The new full carbon integrated OИE RR handlebar is designed for the Pro Road Racing world.Stem and handlebar are integrated into a single structure that ensures maximum cable integration, with a clear advantage in terms of stiffness, comfort and record aerodynamics. Weight 430 grams. AVAILABLES SIZES: 40cc x 90/100 - 42cc x 90/110/120 - 44cc x 120\n\nDiscover the new ITM wheels Find out more about the ITM wheels developed exclusively for Bottecchia. FIND OUT MORE\n\nREPARTO CORSE TECHNOLOGIES Unidirectional monocoque carbon frame, produced with double mold DMMT (Double Mold Monocoque Technology) technology which makes the frame 20% more resistant, without increasing its weight. Thanks to the parallel arrangement of the carbon fibers it is possible to orient the direction of resistance of the fiber depending on the stress to which the various parts are subjected, without increasing the quantity of carbon required. Aerodynamic efficiency is guaranteed by the fully integrated cable routing thanks to IRC (Internal Routing Cables) technology and by the carbon seatpost with integrated aero-derived collar. To complete the set-up, the new integrated OИE RR full carbon handlebar, perfected for internal cable mounting, and for better rideability. IDEAL FOR Designed for long distances, it guarantees easy and safe handling. Perfect for climbs thanks to its reduced weight and its greater rigidity, it is stable and fast even downhill, where it makes the difference thanks to its aerodynamics with internal wiring. PERFECT FOR YOU IF 8avio Ultimate is the quintessence of road bikes: latest generation technology, refined design, high level performance but an absolutely competitive price.",
